  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/06/IMG_8572.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(15 fotos) House Cafe, en la calle Comare Elisa Meseguer, 2 de Onda, ha acogido nuevamente la noche de este s&aacute;bado&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">cena, a partir de las 21 horas, y&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/06/IMG_8608.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt;\">baile posterior con bachatas, salsa, merengue, cha cha cha, foxtrot, cumbia, sevillanas, baladas, tango o rock.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt;\">La &uacute;ltima sesi&oacute;n de cena y baile hasta septiembre est&aacute; prevista para el s&aacute;bado 16 de junio. Las reservas se pueden realizar en el tel&eacute;fono 964 63 93 45.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparball020618housecafe/img_8564.jpg\" alt=\"img_8564\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparball020618housecafe/img_8565.jpg\" alt=\"img_8565\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparball020618housecafe/img_8567.jpg\" alt=\"img_8567\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparball020618housecafe/img_8570.jpg\" alt=\"img_8570\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparball020618housecafe/img_8572.jpg\" alt=\"img_8572\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparball020618housecafe/img_8573.jpg\" alt=\"img_8573\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparball020618housecafe/img_8603.jpg\" alt=\"img_8603\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparball020618housecafe/img_8606.jpg\" alt=\"img_8606\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparball020618housecafe/img_8607.jpg\" alt=\"img_8607\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparball020618housecafe/img_8608.jpg\" alt=\"img_8608\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparball020618housecafe/img_8609.jpg\" alt=\"img_8609\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparball020618housecafe/img_8610.jpg\" alt=\"img_8610\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparball020618housecafe/img_8611.jpg\" alt=\"img_8611\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparball020618housecafe/img_8612.jpg\" alt=\"img_8612\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparball020618housecafe/img_8613.jpg\" alt=\"img_8613\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
